{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/4443c073e2c0f337818718180dab8ace.avif?t=1773964959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras_big/4443c073e2c0f337818718180dab8ace.avif?t=1773964959 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three stoners named Lil Bro, Big Bro and Cole  accidentally become possessed by the soul of an Ancient Cosmic Wizard. This leads to them finding out they have a prophesised duty to resurrect the Cosmic Wizard from the dead. But since they're too lazy to do all that, they instead decide to go on an adventure to find and collect 3 magical stones that can be used in a ritual to remove the Wizard's soul from them. Shenanigans ensue. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TURN-BASED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/ff6791cbb6b3e814f04077831cb8bfa5.avif?t=1773964959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras_big/ff6791cbb6b3e814f04077831cb8bfa5.avif?t=1773964959 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STONED features unique &quot;pong-style&quot; combat mechanics in its battle system. When enemies attack you, they\u2019ll throw coloured projectiles your way. You avoid enemy attacks by aligning yourself with their projectile and performing a certain action based on its colour to deflect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.poster.avif?t=1773964959\" width=450 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.webm?t=1773964959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.mp4?t=1773964959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/18b2975b2a5396764593b15eec289c10.avif?t=1773964959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras_big/18b2975b2a5396764593b15eec289c10.avif?t=1773964959 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real time arcade-style combat mechanics where timing is key to success</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to extend your magical powers through.. unconventional means..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based RPG mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expressive and catchy soundtrack by Noah Simcox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irregular RPG enemy encounters like gang bosses, gas-station tweakers and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurd character-driven narrative with both comedic and emotional themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of new areas with lots of items to find and NPCs to talk to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical spells and other fantasy themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORD FROM THE CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLE SAYS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar